            (nmcp-model "translation.hati-translator-f16-local" "translation" "text" "local-native" "shadow" "observed" "local-process" "ollama" "hati-translator:latest" "4e5fc5e5304928bb09d6e6fe757d1bf47af6386d2f91b085b45afafabaf4a71a" "lineage-not-verified-today" "receipts/2026-08-03-selfnamed.md; own header read 2026-08-03: llama, 28 blocks, header names no model" "unmeasured-on-sealed-task" 0 0 0 25 "verify whether this f16 is the unquantized parent of translation.hati-lora-q4 and, only then, move it to local-finetuned with that row's training receipt" 20260803 7 0 0 0 0)
            (nmcp-model "base.form-llama-vital-ground-f16" "form-knowledge" "text" "local-native" "shadow" "observed" "local-process" "unbound-gguf-file" "form-llama-vital-ground-f16.gguf" "67c0da7b2b4b2cacdf68b04a36f93df7592640387ff2b831b636d5ec53b6aabe" "lineage-not-verified-today" "receipts/2026-08-03-selfnamed.md; sha256 computed 2026-08-03; own header read 2026-08-03: llama, 28 blocks, general.name form-llama-vital-ground" "unmeasured-on-sealed-task" 0 0 0 28 "establish whether this file is the export of llm.form-llama-lora and bind it to a runtime; a GGUF nothing loads is inventory, not a lane" 20260803 7 0 0 0 0)
            (nmcp-model "base.form-llama-vital-ground-q4km" "form-knowledge" "text" "local-native" "shadow" "observed" "local-process" "unbound-gguf-file" "form-llama-vital-ground-q4_k_m.gguf" "dba8d50e3c63bde16cd918bb4de8e7cde6c5a2dae9a8360bd14480e71d8d7fa4" "lineage-not-verified-today" "receipts/2026-08-03-selfnamed.md; sha256 computed 2026-08-03; own header read 2026-08-03: llama, 28 blocks, general.name form-llama-vital-ground" "unmeasured-on-sealed-task" 0 0 0 27 "same question as the f16 row, plus whether the two differ by more than quantization on one sealed split" 20260803 7 0 0 0 0)

            ; ── CLAIMED 2026-08-04, after model-discovery.fk learned safetensors' own spelling. ──
            ; A safetensors file declares its own shape — u64 LE header length, then a JSON header
            ; naming every tensor — and eleven such files across nine huggingface-hub repos had been
            ; on this host, invisible, for the length of one more byte-question nobody had asked.
            ; Every row below is `observed`, score 0, samples 0: present on disk, read by its own
            ; header on 2026-08-04 (tensor counts and byte totals are the file's own declaration,
            ; cross-checked against an independent reader the same day), measured against nothing.
            ; The runtime is the honest one: no lane on this body loads a safetensors file yet, so
            ; these are inventory the walk can now see, not lanes — the same standing the two
            ; unbound GGUF exports above hold. tensors= counts every entry the header names,
            ; quantization scales included, which is why the mlx 4-bit llama says 648 where its
            ; GGUF sibling says 28 blocks: different questions, both answered by the file itself.
